[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1440PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Credits-207-,FOT-Greco Std B Strp,50,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,95,100,1.6,0,1,3,0,7,16,16,16,1Style: Flashbacks-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Narrator-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,180,180,27,1Style: Captions-207-,Chinacat,99,&H00FFFFFF,&H000019FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,5,0,1,3.4,0,2,16,16,27,1Style: Main-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Thoughts-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.4,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Title-207-,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,383,1Style: Secondary-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,8,23,23,23,1Style: Kanji,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,8,23,23,146,1Style: Kanji-furigana,Duality,60,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.375,0,8,23,23,225,1Style: Translation,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,2,23,23,34,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:01:56.74,0:01:58.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't you...Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.34,0:02:00.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,peeking the wrong way?Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.59,0:02:11.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too late now... and you're still clearly visible.Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.04,0:02:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just what are you?Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.36,0:02:15.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up, human!Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.92,0:02:17.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also, how's your fever?Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It talked!Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.65,0:02:29.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.86,0:02:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your fever seems to have come down a little, girl.Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.31,0:02:44.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are ya happy?Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you?Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.87,0:02:54.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm, 38.2 degrees... Not too shabby.Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.70,0:03:00.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor. Dr. Kureha. Call me Doctorine.Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.17,0:03:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor... Then I'm in the...Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The secret to my youth?Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't ask that.Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.36,0:03:16.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right. You're in the castle on top of the mountain.Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.39,0:03:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then there were two others with me, right?Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.55,0:03:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're sound asleep in the next room.Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.69,0:03:24.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What tough guys...Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.10,0:03:27.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look here.Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.23,0:03:30.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This was the cause.Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What... is this?Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.79,0:03:35.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were bitten by a kestia.Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.33,0:03:39.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a poisonous tick that's only found in hot and humid jungles.Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.12,0:03:42.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once you're bitten by it, bacteria enter your bodyDialogue: 50,0:03:42.81,0:03:46.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and incubate for five days, all while causing you pain.Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.68,0:03:53.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fevers run above 40 degrees with coinfection, myocarditis, arteritis, and cerebritis.Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.15,0:03:57.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Judging by the spread of infection, I'd say you were bitten three days ago.Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.74,0:04:01.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must have suffered through immense pain.Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.65,0:04:04.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, even without treatment, it'd have ended after two more days.Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.96,0:04:06.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After two more days...?Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.73,0:04:10.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. After two more days, you would have died.Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.69,0:04:11.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.34,0:04:15.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's called the "five-day disease."Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.09,0:04:18.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had heard that kestias died out a century ago,Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.85,0:04:21.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so it's good that I kept the antibiotic just in case.Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.83,0:04:24.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did you guys come from?Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.17,0:04:28.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Were you walking around on a prehistoric jungle island with your belly exposed?Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.07,0:04:32.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that's just silly...Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.75,0:04:32.88,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah...Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That ring a bell?Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a crazy girl...Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.85,0:04:40.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now...Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.65,0:04:45.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stay in bed. Your treatment hasn't finished yet.Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.79,0:04:49.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help. But my fever is much better already.Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.33,0:04:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can heal on my own now, right?Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.23,0:04:53.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're too optimistic.Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.40,0:04:58.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This disease normally takes a minimum of ten days to fully treat.Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.03,0:05:03.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, you want it to flare up again and kill you this time.Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.20,0:05:07.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even with my medicine, you'll have to rest at least three days.Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.10,0:05:07.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What...?Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here for three days!Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.16,0:05:11.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi must reach Arabasta soon!Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.67,0:05:18.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A patient only leaves my care one of two ways:Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,cured or dead.Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not leaving here.Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.48,0:05:53.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He climbed this mountain with his bare hands?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.06,0:05:55.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This 5,000-meter-high Drum Rock?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.76,0:06:00.16,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Nearly his entire body is frostbitten.Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.16,0:06:02.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking dressing like this?Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.38,0:06:04.47,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Throw him in a warm bath immediately.Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.17,0:06:10.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This guy's bleeding badly. Six broken ribs and a spinal fissure.Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Can I operate on him?Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.06,0:06:18.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This girl's the most critical. She's barely alive.Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.03,0:06:22.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper, ready some phenicol, cardiotonic, and tialcillin.Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Does she have an infection?Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.19,0:06:27.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the pathogen isn't from this island.Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.89,0:06:37.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll make both that bleeding kid and this girl all better.Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.85,0:06:38.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You can relax.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.19,0:06:43.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Th-They're my f-friends...!Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.19,0:06:51.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I get the picture. I'll help them.Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Let's begin treatment!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.86,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Th-They're my f-friends...!Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.25,0:07:05.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.86,0:07:09.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry...Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.77,0:07:15.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meat...Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.50,0:07:23.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Venison stew needs to be cooked in a pot for three hours,Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.20,0:07:25.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then the meat becomes properly tender.Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.02,0:07:30.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Venison...!Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.10,0:07:42.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh! Help!Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.72,0:07:45.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, meat!Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.36,0:07:53.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy! I'll cook him for you!Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.62,0:08:02.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.86,0:08:03.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.89,0:08:05.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You got better?Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.34,0:08:06.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.63,0:08:10.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, then! I'll make a nutritious venison dish for Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Wait! – Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.49,0:08:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised! They can already move around?Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.62,0:08:25.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that talking stuffed deer with the blue nose?Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.19,0:08:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're asking me what he is?Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.78,0:08:28.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't run away, meat!Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.45,0:08:31.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy! I'm telling you not to eat it yet!Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it, humans!Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.29,0:08:40.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His name is Chopper. He's just a reindeer with a blue nose.Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.69,0:08:43.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Reindeer don't talk.Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.63,0:08:45.63,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,S-Stop it, you jerks!Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.63,0:08:49.09,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,S-Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.32,0:08:49.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he's different from ordinary reindeer in some way...Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.59,0:08:51.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he's different...?Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.31,0:08:56.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not food!Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.46,0:09:02.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...it's just because he ate a Human-Human Fruit. That's all.Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.90,0:09:04.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Human-Human Fruit...Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.93,0:09:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One of the devil fruits...Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.86,0:09:13.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He's become a reindeer with human abilities.Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rats! Rats!Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.07,0:09:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I taught him everything I know about medicine.Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.63,0:09:28.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's already over?Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.89,0:09:34.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a disappointing bunch.Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.60,0:09:38.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What was that?! – Amazing...Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.56,0:09:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazing...Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.73,0:09:46.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right! Good job, Zoro! Just as I instructed!Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's find Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.74,0:09:55.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.03,0:09:58.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Dig everywhere!Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.50,0:10:03.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what's all this fuss about?Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.67,0:10:06.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later! Let's help them!Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.96,0:10:09.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san! Please be alive!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Join my crew! Please, old lady!Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need a doctor on our ship!Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.02,0:10:28.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! You said that's your name, right?Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.52,0:10:29.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did, old la–Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.36,0:10:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch... what you say!Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.82,0:10:40.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm still in my youthful 130s.Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.04,0:10:42.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa. What an incredible old hag.Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.42,0:10:46.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you asking me to be a pirate?Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.71,0:10:51.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! It'd be a waste of my glorious time.Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.80,0:10:54.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in the sea.Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.05,0:10:58.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Let's go on an adventure, old lady!Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.39,0:11:02.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey now. I just told you to watch what you say, didn't I?Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.89,0:11:04.77,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,So they're pirates...Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.69,0:11:14.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, meat!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.74,0:11:14.53,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.74,0:11:19.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you brats!Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.17,0:11:28.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.63,0:11:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Nami-san! I'll cook a nutritious reindeer dish!Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.59,0:11:37.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before that, I'll eat you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– The old hag! – The old hag!Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.05,0:11:40.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where the heck did she come from?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.47,0:11:41.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's coming! She's coming! She's coming! She's coming!Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.72,0:11:42.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's coming! She's coming! She's coming! She's coming!Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.01,0:11:42.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's coming! She's coming! She's coming! She's coming!Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.31,0:11:43.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's coming! She's coming! She's coming! She's coming!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.73,0:11:51.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forget the food. I just want some peace and quiet.Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.49,0:12:00.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Snow? Even though we're inside the castle...?Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.45,0:12:02.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So cold!Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.16,0:12:07.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll close the door.Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.16,0:12:07.83,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stay in bed!Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.21,0:12:12.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You still have a fever!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.21,0:12:15.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't. It seems like it's pretty much gone.Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.71,0:12:17.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like I lost them...Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.22,0:12:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even so, no!Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.93,0:12:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine's medicine makes the fever go away quickly.Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the kestia's bacteria still remain in your body.Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.31,0:12:29.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to have your antibiotic shot and stay in bed.Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.65,0:12:31.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.94,0:12:35.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've been taking care of me, right?Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.82,0:12:36.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sh...Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.07,0:12:39.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.86,0:12:43.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be thanked by a human!Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.58,0:12:47.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't mock me! You jerk!Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, you dummy!Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously, don't be so...Dialogue: 51,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously, don't be so...Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.25,0:12:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's quite the open book, isn't he?Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.63,0:13:03.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This castle is strange. It's cold and there's snow inside.Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.51,0:13:04.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh...?Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.56,0:13:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! It's cold!Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You keep taking your sweet time with that!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.86,0:13:18.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at this.Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.62,0:13:27.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's snow everywhere in the castle.Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.20,0:13:32.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The doors for the unused rooms are all frozen, too.Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.27,0:13:49.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it! Hold it! Hold it!Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.52,0:14:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Whoa! Hey, Luffy! Stop asking that old bag to join us!Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.19,0:14:03.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's not a doctor, she's a murderer!Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.29,0:14:10.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you guys pirates?Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.00,0:14:10.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes...Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,R-Real ones?Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Real ones.Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.67,0:14:16.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have a flag with a skull?Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.25,0:14:19.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's attached to our ship. Are you interested in pirates?Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.92,0:14:22.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You idiot! No!Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.18,0:14:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.97,0:14:32.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... then...Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.06,0:14:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,wanna come too?Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.73,0:14:38.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To the sea! Why don't you come with us?Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.57,0:14:39.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you do, it'll really help me out!Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.90,0:14:45.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With a doctor, I won't have to stay here for three days, right?Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.57,0:14:47.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On top of that, on our ship, we–Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.70,0:14:53.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can stay with humans!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.62,0:14:59.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To start with, don't you get scared when you see me?Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.17,0:15:03.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer, but I stand on two legs and I even speak.Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.84,0:15:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Are you trying to scare me?Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My nose is blue, too...Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.61,0:15:22.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There you are!Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.36,0:15:24.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.03,0:15:27.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Wait! – Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.74,0:15:34.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those brats sure are quick.Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't like it, girl.Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.75,0:15:40.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.75,0:15:44.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who gave you permission to tempt the reindeer behind my back?Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.51,0:15:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? Do I need permission to make a move on a man?Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.60,0:15:53.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, you don't. If you wanna take him, go right ahead.Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it won't be easy.Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.23,0:16:01.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He has a scar in his heart— a big scar that even I can't cure.Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.23,0:16:05.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The moment he came into this world, his herd and his parents abandoned him.Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.32,0:16:06.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.32,0:16:09.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was all because of his blue nose.Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.99,0:16:14.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He always walked at the very back of the herd all by himselfDialogue: 50,0:16:14.87,0:16:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even though he was just a newborn child.Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.46,0:16:23.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After he ate a devil fruit, he was treated like a true monster.Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.56,0:16:38.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The other reindeer drove him out of the herd.Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.19,0:16:43.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There was no way he could ever go back to being an ordinary reindeer.Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.32,0:16:47.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Still, he wanted friends...Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.40,0:16:50.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So he went down to a village, this time as a human.Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.07,0:16:53.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's that creature?Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.62,0:16:57.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But his figure wasn't exactly human, either.Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.87,0:17:01.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For some reason, his nose also remained blue.Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.08,0:17:02.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It must be a yeti!Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.58,0:17:05.63,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous! Get the children inside quickly!Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.38,0:17:09.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A gun! Bring me a gun!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Shoot it dead!Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.09,0:17:11.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You damn monster!Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.43,0:17:13.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.57,0:17:33.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He didn't know what was wrong,Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,nor did he know what to blame.Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.41,0:17:38.25,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You damn monster!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.25,0:17:40.12,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You damn monster!Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.12,0:17:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All he wanted were friends, but he was called a monster...Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.17,0:17:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was no longer a reindeer.Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.80,0:17:49.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He wasn't a human, either.Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.97,0:17:55.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And so, he had to live alone.Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.39,0:18:00.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you guys heal the scar in his heart?Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.48,0:18:07.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. Look at that door at the front entrance. It's wide open.Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.99,0:18:13.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's cold.Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In any case, let's close this door.Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.20,0:18:18.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we might as well be out in the snow.Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.49,0:18:21.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop it! Don't touch that door!Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.08,0:18:27.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never mind him. Let's close it, or we'll freeze to death.Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.00,0:18:27.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Definitely.Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.34,0:18:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Didn't I tell you to...Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.21,0:18:32.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,stop it?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.72,0:18:41.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with him? Why is he angry?Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. Come over here.Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.61,0:18:53.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look up there.Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.45,0:19:06.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're snowbird hatchlings. So, if we close the door, they'll fall.Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.17,0:19:09.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why they can't close it.Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.93,0:19:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– It's cold! – It's cold!Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.94,0:19:26.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.40,0:19:27.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.73,0:19:27.44,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.15,0:19:30.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't he talk just now?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.69,0:19:33.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And come to think of it, he was standing on two legs.Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.61,0:19:37.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– He's a monster! – He's a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.66,0:19:41.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck is that?Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.16,0:19:44.20,Main-207-,,220,1,0,,He's walking on two legs...Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.21,Main-207-,,10,200,0,,He's a reindeer...Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.21,0:19:45.91,Main-207-,,200,10,0,,He's fluffy...Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.91,0:19:46.87,Main-207-,,1,0,0,,He's short...Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.87,0:19:48.92,Main-207-,,200,1,0,,He becomes big...Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.92,0:19:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– And he's a monster! – And he's a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.35,0:20:07.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a cool guy! I like him!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.19,0:20:12.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Let's have him join us!Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.30,Title-207-,,0,0,290,,Enter: Tony Tony ChopperDialogue: 1,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.30,Title-207-,,0,0,290,,Enter: Tony Tony ChopperDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 GigglebotDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 GigglebotDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,archıt3chtDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,archıt3chtDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack ScolinesDialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack Sc